   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "On Motzaei Yom Tov that is not Motzaei Shabbat, one does not bless over the spices or the candle."
  },
  "he:Havdalah/Havdala:12": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b>בָּרוּךְ</b> אַתָּה יְהֹוָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " בּוֹרֵא עֲצֵי ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small>(עִשְׂבֵּי) (מִינֵי)</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
